A '''Bambuleaf''' is a [[Critter]] that can be found on the {{Zone|Moonglade Marsh}}.

== Spawning ==
'''Bambuleafs''' spawn in the {{zone|Tranquility Sanctum}} from early spring to late summer.

== Behavior ==
'''Bambuleafs''' can be fed {{Item|Bamboo}} to grow in size. If the player feeds a '''Bambuleaf''' {{Item|Bamboo|amount=40-44}}, it will pass out and drop a {{Item|Bambuleaf Shard}}.

